msgctxt "Languages::ab__mcd.additional_features.placeholders.text"
msgid "<code>[year]</code> - this year;<br> <code>[month]</code> - current month as it is;<br> <code>[month_lower]</code> - force to make the letters in lower case;<br> <code>[Month]</code> - the first letter is capital, the rest are in lower case;<br> <code>[MONTH]</code> - all letters are capital.<br> <code>[category]</code> - category name as it is;<br> <code>[category_lower]</code> - force to make the letters in lower case;<br> <code>[Category]</code> - the first letter is capital, the rest are in lower case;<br> <code>[CATEGORY]</code> - all letters are capital.<br> <br> <code>[storefront]</code> - storefront name as it is;<br> <code>[storefront_lower]</code> - force to make the letters in lower case;<br> <code>[Storefront]</code> - the first letter is capital, the rest are in lower case;<br> <code>[STOREFRONT]</code> - all letters are capital.<br> <br> <code>[products]</code> - product list from the \"Dynamic filling\" tab.<br> <br> When the <b>Custom Title H1 PRO</b> add-on is active the following placeholders will be available:<br> <code>[custom_category_h1]</code>; <code>[custom_category_h1_lower]</code>; <code>[Custom_category_h1]</code>; <code>[CUSTOM_CATEGORY_H1]</code>.<br> <br> When the <b>Advanced meta tags and placeholders</b> add-on is active the following placeholder will be available:<br> <code>[ab__mcd_name]</code> - follows the behavior of the placeholder [category], for feature variant pages - behavior of the placeholder [brand], for pages - behavior of the placeholder [page]<br>"
msgstr "<code>[year]</code> - this year;<br>"
"<code>[month]</code> - current month as it is;<br>"
"<code>[month_lower]</code> - force to make the letters in lower case;<br>"
"<code>[Month]</code> - the first letter is capital, the rest are in lower case;<br>"
"<code>[MONTH]</code> - all letters are capital.<br>"
"<code>[category]</code> - category name as it is;<br>"
"<code>[category_lower]</code> - force to make the letters in lower case;<br>"
"<code>[Category]</code> - the first letter is capital, the rest are in lower case;<br>"
"<code>[CATEGORY]</code> - all letters are capital.<br>"
"<br>"
"<code>[storefront]</code> - storefront name as it is;<br>"
"<code>[storefront_lower]</code> - force to make the letters in lower case;<br>"
"<code>[Storefront]</code> - the first letter is capital, the rest are in lower case;<br>"
"<code>[STOREFRONT]</code> - all letters are capital.<br>"
"<br>"
"<code>[products]</code> - product list from the \"Dynamic filling\" tab.<br>"
"<br>"
"When the <b>Custom Title H1 PRO</b> add-on is active the following placeholders will be available:<br>"
"<code>[custom_category_h1]</code>; <code>[custom_category_h1_lower]</code>; <code>[Custom_category_h1]</code>; <code>[CUSTOM_CATEGORY_H1]</code>.<br>"
"<br>"
"When the <b>Advanced meta tags and placeholders</b> add-on is active the following placeholder will be available:<br>"
"<code>[ab__mcd_name]</code> - follows the behavior of the placeholder [category], for feature variant pages - behavior of the placeholder [brand], for pages - behavior of the placeholder [page]<br>"

msgctxt "Languages::ab__mcd.additional_features.placeholders.text.ab__seo_filter"
msgid "When the <b>SEO pages for filters</b> add-on is active then available will be:<br> <code>%category%</code>; <code>%category_lower%</code>; <code>%Category%</code>; <code>%CATEGORY%</code>; <code>%filter%</code>; <code>%filter_lower%</code>; <code>%Filter%</code>; <code>%FILTER%</code>; <code>%variant%</code>; <code>%variant_lower%</code>; <code>%Variant%</code>; <code>%VARIANT%</code>\""
msgstr "When the <b>SEO pages for filters</b> add-on is active then available will be:<br>"
"<code>%category%</code>; <code>%category_lower%</code>; <code>%Category%</code>; <code>%CATEGORY%</code>; <code>%filter%</code>; <code>%filter_lower%</code>; <code>%Filter%</code>; <code>%FILTER%</code>; <code>%variant%</code>; <code>%variant_lower%</code>; <code>%Variant%</code>; <code>%VARIANT%</code>\""

